@startuml US050_SSD
title US050 - Register an Air Control Area - SSD

actor "Backoffice Operator" as Operator
participant "SEM4PI Backoffice System" as System

Operator -> System : request to register a new Air Control Area
System --> Operator : ask for area data (code, name, boundaries, minimum reserve fuel rule)

Operator -> System : provide code, name, minLatitude, maxLatitude, minLongitude, maxLongitude, minimumReserveFuelRule
System --> Operator : confirmation of registered Air Control Area

alt area code already exists
    System --> Operator : show error (duplicate code)
else invalid boundary values
    System --> Operator : show error (invalid boundaries)
else not authenticated / not authorized
    System --> Operator : show access denied message
end

@enduml
